<title>USA: United States Enrichment Corp Q2 net lower.</title>
<headline>United States Enrichment Corp Q2 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNITED STATES ENRICHMENT CORP</p>
<p>				   3 Mos ended 12/31 6 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>							  (millions)</p>
<p>					     1996    1995   1996   1995</p>
<p> Revenue				 $485.1  $453.3 $908.0 $680.5</p>
<p> Cost of sales			  364.2   315.3  672.1  455.2</p>
<p> Gross profit			   120.9   138.0  235.9  225.3</p>
<p>Other operating expenses:</p>
<p>  Project development costs (a)    39.2    22.1   74.9   35.7</p>
<p>  SG&amp;A					8.6     8.2   17.2   18.4</p>
<p>  Other (income) and expense, net (0.9)   (1.4)  (3.2)  (1.9)</p>
<p> Net income (b)			  74.0   109.1  147.0  173.1</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Project development costs primarily represent research and development spending for the future commercialization of AVLIS uranium enrichment technology.</p>
<p>(b) As a U.S. government corporation, USEC is exempt from federal, state and local income taxes.</p>
